/// M04 CORE-012 "bundled coordination: roots green".
/// Source: tests/integration/coordination_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentBundledCoordination.
/// Related fixtures: compiler/testdata/current/coordination/main.can
/// (ground for every per-function pin below: one 1, text 1,
/// unavailable 1, fail_all 1, aggregate_size 1, summarize 1, observe 1,
/// main 1 = 8 roots) and runtime/test/coordination.test.ts (the staged
/// bun trace pinned by trace-pass/trace-fail).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): canlc assert green with passed report and exactly
/// 8 roots grounded per function in main.can, the sibling fixture row
/// counts from the Go loop table, and the staged bun trace counts.
/// Selection semantics live in core-012-coordination-selection.can; the run
/// output/status shape and silent production entry live in
/// core-012-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: main fixture; the aggregate-composition (37) and
/// heterogeneous (7) loop rows are pinned as counts verbatim from the Go
/// table (per-function detail for those fixtures is outside this row's
/// related_sources).
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. Logical gates SUITE/DIAG/FAULT and
/// C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23; no live run now.
/// Delegated oracles: DELEGATE-009 (runtime/test/coordination.test.ts,
/// read-only record; 15 declarations; not executed here).
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23/QN1/QN2/QN3 unmet).
/// Case bundled/coordination-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-name, one-roots, text-roots, unavailable-roots,
/// fail-all-roots, aggregate-size-roots, summarize-roots, observe-roots,
/// main-roots, composition-rows, heterogeneous-rows, trace-pass, trace-fail.
/// Facet map (coordination_test.go legs): assert-green pins the assert leg
/// (L80-83: exit 0, empty stderr); report-passed/root-count pin the report
/// leg (L84-87: passed true, 8 assertions for main); fixture-name grounds
/// the 8 roots in main.can (L75-79); one-roots pins one (main.can L7:
/// sample => ok 1); text-roots pins text (L12: sample => ok "two");
/// unavailable-roots pins unavailable (L17: sample => codec::invalid_data);
/// fail-all-roots pins fail_all (L25: sample => all_failed 1 leaf);
/// aggregate-size-roots pins aggregate_size (L34: sample => ok 1);
/// summarize-roots pins summarize (L43: empty [] => ok 0); observe-roots
/// pins observe (L48: sample => ok 2); main-roots pins main (L62: empty []
/// => ok); composition-rows pins the loop table (L74:
/// aggregate-composition 37); heterogeneous-rows pins the loop table (L74:
/// heterogeneous 7); trace-pass/trace-fail pin the staged bun trace (L32:
/// "15 pass", "0 fail").
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
